# Registry for this project. npm and pnpm both read this file.
#
# https, not http: the plain-http endpoint answers 302 to the https one, so
# plain http would only add a redirect per request and expose the first hop.
#
# Neither TSINGHUA (TUNA) NOR ALIYUN is used here. TUNA does not mirror the npm
# registry at all -- mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn serves PyPI, Debian and Ubuntu,
# but /npm/ returns 404.
#
# This file is committed, so it applies to everyone who clones the repo. Delete
# it, or point `registry` back at https://registry.npmjs.org/ , if this mirror is
# slower or unreachable from your network. It does NOT affect the Docker build:
# the deps stage installs before any source is copied, so the image takes its
# registry from the NPM_REGISTRY build arg instead (see Dockerfile).
registry=https://mirrors.cloud.tencent.com/npm/
